	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ランドロスさまの　ほこらに
イタズラ　すると▽
おおあらしに　なるんだぞー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ランドロスさまの　ほこらに
イタズラ　すると▽
おおあらしに　なるんだぞー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・弟を追いかけて、
主人公の前に立ってからのセリフ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>兄</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！▼
おおあめ　ふらせて
カミナリを　おっことすのは▽
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うもーん！▼
大雨　降らせて
カミナリを　落っことすのは▽
他の　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>●WHITE
・主人公の背後から叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！▼
おおあめ　ふらせて
かぜを　びゅーびゅー　させるのは▽
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うもーん！▼
大雨　降らせて
風を　びゅーびゅー　させるのは▽
他の　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>●BLACK
・主人公の背後から叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうよ　バカっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:35:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うよ　バカっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・叫んでから、
主人公の背後にいる弟を追いかける。
・弟は主人公の正面へ逃げる。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>兄</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わるさした　ポケモンを　こらしめた
ランドロスさまの　ほこら　なんだぞ！▼
ほこらに　イタズラを　すると
あらしを　おこす　ポケモンが▽
また　でてきても▽
こらしめて　くれなくなるんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>悪さした　ポケモンを　こらしめた
ランドロスさまの　ほこら　なんだぞ！▼
ほこらに　イタズラを　すると
あらしを　おこす　ポケモンが▽
また　でてきても▽
こらしめて　くれなくなるんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・主人公の背後に回りこんでから。
逃げた弟に向かって叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>兄</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わるさする　ポケモンが　いたら
ランドロスさまが　でてきて▽
やっつけて　くれるもーん！▼
にいちゃんの　ほうが
ばかだもーんっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>悪さする　ポケモンが　いたら
ランドロスさまが　でてきて▽
やっつけて　くれるもーん！▼
にいちゃんの　ほうが
ばかだもーんっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・叫んで、退場。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まてよ　ばかっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:37:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>待てよ　ばかっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:37:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・叫んで、弟を追いかけ退場。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>兄</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
